        <h2>Hi, I'm Iuliana.</h2>
        <p>I work with singers and speakers who want two things that usually get treated as opposites: precise technique, and a voice that feels free. Some weeks we drill breath support and pitch control. Other weeks the work is quieter — releasing tension that's been sitting in the throat for years.</p>
