            <path d="M0,30 L20,10 L40,50 L60,5 L80,55 L100,20 L120,40 L140,15 L160,45 L180,25 L200,30" />
          </svg>
          <h3>Vocal Coaching</h3>
          <p>Technical training for singers who want to sing with more range, control, and consistency. We work on breath support, pitch accuracy, resonance, and repertoire — building habits that hold up on stage, not just in the practice room.</p>
          <p class="lesson-card__for"><!-- Edit this line to describe who it's for -->Best for: singers preparing for performance, auditions, or building a stronger technical foundation.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="lesson-card lesson-card--healing">
          <svg class="lesson-card__icon" viewBox="0 0 200 60" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M0,30 C25,10 45,50 70,30 C95,10 115,50 140,30 C165,10 185,50 200,30" />
          </svg>
          <h3>Vocal Healing</h3>
          <p>A gentler practice for reconnecting with your voice without the pressure of performance. We use breath, sound, and guided vocalisation to release tension, ease vocal fatigue, and rebuild trust in a voice that's felt blocked, tired, or lost.</p>
          <p class="lesson-card__for"><!-- Edit this line to describe who it's for -->Best for: anyone recovering from vocal strain, stage fright, or simply wanting to feel at home in their own voice again.</p>
        </article>

